          "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_diffusion_models_produce_stunning_sa",
          "text": "Diffusion models produce stunning samples, but they are slow, often needing a thousand sequential denoising steps to generate a single sample. This paper from Stanford asks a different question than most prior work.",
          "expected_role": "title",
          "cue_keywords": [
