          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_standard_denoising_diffusion_probabi",
          "text": "A standard denoising diffusion probabilistic model can take a thousand sequential passes through the neural network to create one sample, which is far too slow for interactive use.",
