          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_popular_fix_simply_fewer_denoising",
          "text": "The popular fix is to simply use fewer denoising steps, as DDIM and DPMSolver do, but reducing steps comes at the cost of sample quality.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
