    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "motivation",
      "heading": "Motivation",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_authors_pursue_orthogonal_direction",
          "text": "The authors pursue an orthogonal direction. Instead of trading quality for speed, they ask whether we can trade compute for speed.",
