          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_first_seems_impossible_because_denoi",
          "text": "At first this seems impossible, because denoising is inherently sequential: each step depends on the previous one.",
