          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_general_method_lets_you",
          "text": "It is the first general method that lets you spend extra parallel compute to sample a pretrained diffusion model faster, without any retraining.",
