          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_crucially_orthogonal_existing_techni",
          "text": "Crucially, it is orthogonal to existing techniques, so it can be layered on top of DDIM or DPMSolver to yield ParaDDIM and ParaDPMSolver, combining both axes of speedup.",
